dsh-web-pick is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE).

The webview injection approach — injecting an overlay into the built-in
browser's Electron <webview> from a Client-half plugin, polling an outbox, and
cropping capturePage() screenshots per item — is adapted from:
  dsh-webannotate by FleatherYu
  https://github.com/FleatherYu/dsh-webannotate
  MIT License, Copyright (c) FleatherYu

The overlay source in this repository is an independent rewrite with a
different interaction model (one pick button, element click, drag-to-frame
region, no quote mode); the shared parts are the injection/injection-policy
ideas and the screenshot pipeline. FleatherYu's MIT notice is retained here
for attribution.
